---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import Socials from '../components/Socials.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About | Joy (@le-temps)" activeNav="about">
  <Breadcrumbs />
  <main id="main-content" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 pb-12">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl text-skin-accent font-mono">About</h1>
    
    <article id="article" role="article" class="prose mx-auto mt-8 max-w-3xl font-mono">
      <p>
        Hi, I'm <strong>Joy (@le-temps)</strong>, a graduate researcher at <a href="https://www.ustc.edu.cn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">University of Science and Technology of China (USTC)</a>.
      </p>

      <p>
        My core research focuses on <strong>Large Language Models (LLMs)</strong>, <strong>Autonomous AI Agent Harness & Memory</strong>, and high-performance infrastructure systems.
      </p>

      <h2>💼 Industry & Internship Experience</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 not-prose my-6">
        <!-- JD.com Experience -->
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-skin-line bg-skin-card bg-opacity-30 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 items-start transition-colors">
          <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-white shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 w-12 h-12">
            <!-- JD Logo -->
            <svg class="w-8 h-8" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none">
              <rect width="100" height="100" rx="20" fill="#E1251B" />
              <path d="M50 25C36.19 25 25 36.19 25 50C25 63.81 36.19 75 50 75C63.81 75 75 63.81 75 50C75 36.19 63.81 25 50 25ZM42 42C44.2 42 46 43.8 46 46C46 48.2 44.2 50 42 50C39.8 50 38 48.2 38 46C38 43.8 39.8 42 42 42ZM58 42C60.2 42 62 43.8 62 46C62 48.2 60.2 50 58 50C55.8 50 54 48.2 54 46C54 43.8 55.8 42 58 42ZM50 66C43.5 66 38.5 61.5 38 60H62C61.5 61.5 56.5 66 50 66Z" fill="white"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1 w-full">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1">
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-skin-base font-mono">
                京东集团 (JD.com) · 大模型与搜索算法
              </h3>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono opacity-80 text-skin-accent font-medium whitespace-nowrap">2026.03 - 2026.08</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm opacity-85 text-skin-base leading-relaxed">
              聚焦大语言模型（LLM）微调、搜索 Query 意图理解、AI Agent 检索增强（RAG）与语义匹配算法研发。
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Huawei Cloud Experience -->
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-skin-line bg-skin-card bg-opacity-30 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 items-start transition-colors">
          <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-white shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 w-12 h-12">
            <!-- Huawei Logo -->
            <svg class="w-8 h-8" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none">
              <rect width="100" height="100" rx="20" fill="#ED1C24" />
              <path d="M50 20C48.5 28 44 34 50 50C56 34 51.5 28 50 20Z" fill="white"/>
              <path d="M30 28C33 36 34 43 50 50C34 51 28 44 30 28Z" fill="white"/>
              <path d="M70 28C67 36 66 43 50 50C66 51 72 44 70 28Z" fill="white"/>
              <path d="M18 45C25 50 31 54 50 50C36 60 27 57 18 45Z" fill="white"/>
              <path d="M82 45C75 50 69 54 50 50C64 60 73 57 82 45Z" fill="white"/>
              <path d="M22 68C32 68 40 64 50 50C38 67 28 72 22 68Z" fill="white"/>
              <path d="M78 68C68 68 60 64 50 50C62 67 72 72 78 68Z" fill="white"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1 w-full">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1">
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-skin-base font-mono">
                华为云计算 (Huawei Cloud) · 基础架构研发
              </h3>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono opacity-80 text-skin-accent font-medium whitespace-nowrap">2025.06 - 2025.09</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm opacity-85 text-skin-base leading-relaxed">
              参与华为云原生底层计算基础架构、分布式资源调度与高吞吐算力系统研发，保障云底座高可用与稳定性。
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>🔬 Research Focus</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Autonomous Agent Harness & Guardrails:</strong> Runtime lifecycle interceptors, infinite loop prevention, and tool failure self-healing mechanisms.</li>
        <li><strong>Long-Term Agent Memory:</strong> Self-evolving core memory architectures inspired by MemGPT, cross-session memory consolidation, and active reflection.</li>
        <li><strong>Context & KV Cache Optimization:</strong> Mathematical analysis of attention entropy, sliding window compaction, and lossless history summarization.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>🚀 Open Source Projects</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/le-temps/dsh-plugins-hub" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>dsh-plugins-hub:</strong></a> Production-ready plugin ecosystem for DeepSeek Harness (Core Memory, Token Compactor, Code Guard).</li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/le-temps/ds2api" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>ds2api:</strong></a> High-performance DeepSeek API gateway compatible with standard OpenAI client protocols.</li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/le-temps/academic-research-skills" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>academic-research-skills:</strong></a> Curated toolkits, best practices, and workflows for academic AI researchers.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>📬 Get in Touch</h2>
      <p>
        Feel free to connect for academic collaborations, open-source ideas, or engineering discussions:
      </p>
      <Socials />
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
